Input file containing information on the surface heterogeneity
(used in combination with 'patches.in')
DO NOT add or remove lines. Keep the spaces like NAME= $Value
author: Michael Haugeneder, 25.03.2025

#--------------------------------------------------
#Surface type '0' in patches.in (e.g. bare ground)
MODE_0= 1 #1=same for all pixels, e.g. 2(not yet implemented)=gaussian
T_0= 293.15 #temperature of pixel [K]
Z0_0= 0.01 #aerodynamic roughness length [m]

#--------------------------------------------------
#Surface type '1' in patches.in (e.g. snow)
MODE_1= 1 #1=same for all pixels, e.g. 2(not yet implemented)=gaussian
T_1= 293.15 #temperature of pixel [K]
Z0_1= 0.01 #aerodynamic roughness length [m]
